WEBVTT

00:00:01.006 --> 00:00:04.310
Yo yo yo, what's up chat! We are back! Pulse Swarm, sector seven.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:07.156
The one that has been absolutely destroying me all week.

00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:13.576
Okay, okay. Nice and easy. We just farm the little guys first.

00:00:17.972 --> 00:00:21.154
Shout out to everybody in chat, I appreciate you, for real.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:25.522
Somebody asked what my high score is. It's like, 300K. We are beating that today.

00:00:30.972 --> 00:00:33.882
Watch this. Watch the movement. Clean. So clean.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.859
Ooh, here comes a big wave. Okay, chain it, chain it, chain it!

00:00:43.939 --> 00:00:46.819
Wait. Wait, wait, wait! Twenty! Thirty! No way. No way!

00:00:47.606 --> 00:00:49.346
Oh my god, that laser was this close!

00:00:49.672 --> 00:00:53.032
FIFTY! Fifty combo! Let's go! Chat, did you see that?!

00:00:57.872 --> 00:01:02.672
Honestly? I'm kind of cracked at this game. Like, nobody is touching me right now. Nobody.

00:01:03.739 --> 00:01:07.419
No. No, no, no. Did I just fly into that? It wasn't even moving!

00:01:08.406 --> 00:01:11.886
Chat. Do not clip that. I'm serious. Do not clip that.

00:01:14.772 --> 00:01:18.742
Okay. Focus. We've still got two lives. It's fine. It's fine.

00:01:27.739 --> 00:01:30.920
Okay, warning. Boss time. This thing is called the Overmind.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.829
It killed me eleven times yesterday.

00:01:36.739 --> 00:01:38.539
Move, move, move! Stay on the edges!

00:01:44.006 --> 00:01:48.156
Ah! I got hit! One life. One life left, chat. Nobody talk to me.

00:01:57.672 --> 00:02:00.542
It's at ten percent. Five percent. Come on, come on, come on!

00:02:01.439 --> 00:02:04.102
No way. No way! It's down! Let's go! Let's go!

00:02:04.102 --> 00:02:06.129
Sector seven, done! New high score!

00:02:10.639 --> 00:02:13.482
GG. GG, chat. That one is going in the highlights.

00:02:13.482 --> 00:02:17.519
Okay, that's the stream. Follow if you want to see sector eight. Peace!
